# --- secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
# Templates are committed, real values are not. The negation is repeated with a
# `**/` form so an app-level example (apps/web, apps/api) is trackable too — the
# bare `!.env.example` only un-ignores the repository root.
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key

